[{"title":"送贾彦临训导霍丘","author":"方行","text":"中都会面得从容，两载同听长乐钟。\n天近君门严虎豹，地宽人海混鱼龙。\n承恩自合归宣室，论道安能老辟雍。\n江柳春花增别恨，白头何日更相逢。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":56,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"送薛鹤斋真人代祀天妃还京","author":"王逢","text":"蓬莱宫里上卿班，代祀天妃隔岁还。\n日绕五文皆御气，海浮一发是成山。\n风霆夜护龙鸾节，云雾朝披玉雪颜。\n圣渥既隆玄化盛，转输应尽入秦关。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":57,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"钱塘春感六首 其二","author":"王逢","text":"王气凌虚散晓霞，虎闱麟阁静烟花。\n中天日月迂黄道，沧海风云冷翠华。\n望帝神游夔子国，乌衣梦隔野人家。\n当时举目山河异，岂但红颜泣塞笳。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":58,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"钱塘春感六首 其三","author":"王逢","text":"周南风俗汉衣冠，五色云中忆驻銮。\n璎珞桧高藏白兽，蕊珠花发降文鸾。\n河通织女机丝湿，雨歇巫娥翠黛寒。\n满地吴山谁洒泪，一江春水独凭阑。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":59,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"钱塘春感六首 其五","author":"王逢","text":"瑶池青鸟集觚棱，白塔金凫閟夜灯。\n云母帐虚星采动，水晶宫冷露华凝。\n骊山草暗墟周业，郿坞花繁失汉陵。\n白马素车江海上，依然潮汐撼西兴。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":60,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"钱塘春感六首 其一","author":"王逢","text":"紫罽軿车从六龙，尽随仙曲度青空。\n苍山楼阙旃林里，赤羽旌麾野庙中。\n百姓未忘周大赉，成都元有汉遗风。\n流莺不管伤春恨，冲落桃花满树红。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":61,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"钱塘春感六首 其四","author":"王逢","text":"日华初动衮衣明，剑佩千官隐绣楹。\n五色黼函开玉座，九重汤药下银罂。\n书题凤尾仙曹喜，恩浃螭坳学士荣。\n文化有馀戎事略，铜驼草露不胜情。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":62,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"钱塘春感六首 其六","author":"王逢","text":"金爵觚棱月向低，泠泠清磬万松西。\n五门曙色开龙尾，十日春寒健马蹄。\n红雾不收花气合，绿波初涨柳条齐。\n遗民暗忆名都会，尚绕湖漘唱《大堤》。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":63,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"题马洲书院","author":"王逢","text":"蝌斗秦皆废，灵光鲁独存。\n豆笾漂海国，丹雘暗淮村。\n苔藓花侵础，蒲芦叶拥门。\n青春深雾潦，白日老乾坤。\n德化三王并，威仪百代尊。\n郊麟初隐遁，野兕遂崩奔。\n先辈俱冥漠，诸生罢讲论。\n断编尘树冷，遗像网虫昏。\n尽变衣冠俗，终归礼义源。\n江南游学士，瞻拜敢忘言。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":64,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"秋夜叹","author":"王逢","text":"大星芒鬣张，小星光华开。\n皇天示兵象，胜地今蒿莱。\n河岳气不分，烛龙安在哉？\n参赞道岂谬，积阴故迟回。\n疏风夜萧萧，野燐纷往来。\n安知非游魂，相视白骨哀。\n汩汩饮马窟，云冥望乡台。\n于时负肝胆，慷慨思雄材。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":65,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"如梦令 菰村赋赠","author":"王逢","text":"檐耸数株松子。\n村绕一湾菰米。\n鸥外迥闻鸡，望望云山烟水。\n多此。\n多此。\n酒进玉盘双鲤。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":66,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其一","author":"王冕","text":"梦回诗思不可遏，赤脚溪头夜踏冰。\n忽地风来明月动，彩鸾飞出碧云层。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":67,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其二","author":"王冕","text":"颜色虽殊心不异，漫随时俗混繁华。\n清香吹散乾坤外，不是寻常桃杏花。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":68,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其三","author":"王冕","text":"老梅标致何潇洒，不与寻常草木同。\n可笑燕山人事别，春风只看杏花红。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":69,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其四","author":"王冕","text":"翠华影转宜春苑，苑里红梅一夜开。\n学士赋诗承赐宴，内官传道首绯来。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":70,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其五","author":"王冕","text":"和羹风致谁能解，个个花开耐岁寒。\n五月燕山木黄落，相逢只作画图看。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":71,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其六","author":"王冕","text":"白日迟迟照窗户，深院不知春几许？\n紫箫声转香风回，隔帘踏动燕脂雨。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":72,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其七","author":"王冕","text":"十二阑干一院花，春风犹忆旧京华。\n翠云不隔西湖路，梦入咸平处士家。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":73,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其八","author":"王冕","text":"洞天窅窅无人到，白日丹光出树林。\n仙子竟忘食玉法，笑迎春色绿云阴。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":74,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其九","author":"王冕","text":"彩凤穿花啄石苔，玉窗琼户紫烟开。\n山人不说罗浮梦，却忆玄都观里栽。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":75,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十","author":"王冕","text":"桃杏漫山总粗俗，旧家池馆尚春风。\n道人不作罗浮梦，坐看珊瑚海日红。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":76,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十一","author":"王冕","text":"山林养得寸心丹，岂是清香不耐寒？\n今日春风好颜色，任他自作杏花看。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":77,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十二","author":"王冕","text":"玉妃步月影毵毵，燕罢瑶池酒正酣。\n半夜不知香露冷，春风吹梦过江南。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":78,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十三","author":"王冕","text":"昭阳殿里醉春风，香隔琼帘映浅红。\n翠袖拥云扶不起，玉箫吹过小楼东。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":79,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十四","author":"王冕","text":"罗浮仙子醉春风，玉骨冰肌晕浅红。\n一味清香消不尽，几回飞梦锦云中。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":80,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十五","author":"王冕","text":"仙子归来逸兴赊，梦中犹说旧繁华。\n春风转首情何已？\n却向江南认杏花。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":81,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十六","author":"王冕","text":"仙子云中驾鹤归，翩翩雾佩晓风吹。\n玉肌轻染燕脂色，恰似罗浮夜醉时。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":82,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十七","author":"王冕","text":"满湖水色净娟娟，正是春风二月天。\n醉后不知云尺屋，燕脂飞雨堕楼船。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":83,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十八","author":"王冕","text":"玉骨清臞怯素妆，春风一醉九霞觞。\n绿房午夜娇云暖，不梦梨花梦海棠。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":84,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"红梅十九首 其十九","author":"王冕","text":"烂醉西湖处士家，酒痕吹上水边花。\n东风蛱蝶迷香梦，一树珊瑚月影斜。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":85,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"应教题梅","author":"王冕","text":"剌剌北风吹倒人，乾坤无处不沙尘。\n胡儿冻死长城下，谁信江南别有春。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":86,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其一","author":"王冕","text":"大庾岭头春似海，不是寻常白玉堂。\n昨夜护龙河上看，一天明月四檐霜。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":87,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二","author":"王冕","text":"树头历历见明珠，底用题诗问老逋？\n且买金陵秋露白，小舟载月过西湖。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":88,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三","author":"王冕","text":"江南雪消春渐回，溪东溪西梅花开。\n幽人作诗兴不浅，时复杖藜携酒来。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":89,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其四","author":"王冕","text":"岁寒风致少能解，野草安能识此情？\n春到玉堂浑不觉，清香疏影自分明。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":90,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其五","author":"王冕","text":"五云缥缈隔蓬莱，仙子吹箫月下回。\n转首不知春几许，霜花如雪满瑶台。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":91,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其六","author":"王冕","text":"江南十月春色早，处处梅花当水开。\n玉笛一声霜不小，满天明月鹤飞来。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":92,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其七","author":"王冕","text":"罗浮月白海无尘，玉树琼林处处春。\n半夜禹陵风雨作，屋梁飞动欲生鳞。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":93,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其八","author":"王冕","text":"铁石心肠满面霜，岁寒吾计未全荒。\n相逢休问春何处，定是调羹到玉堂。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":94,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其九","author":"王冕","text":"不向罗浮问醉仙，笑呼孤鹤下吴天。\n春风吹散梅花雪，香满西湖载酒船。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":95,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十","author":"王冕","text":"玉雪玲珑瘦影重，不同桃李媚春风。\n十分清致无人解，犹在旧家池馆中。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":96,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十一","author":"王冕","text":"寒枝错落冻不解，隔水清香招得来。\n午夜风停雪声堕，梅花开尽不知寒。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":97,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十二","author":"王冕","text":"断云流水孤山路，看得春风几树花。\n骑马归来城郭是，月明箫管起谁家？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":98,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十三","author":"王冕","text":"昨夜朔风吹倒人，梅花枝上十分春。\n老夫高卧石窗下，嬴得清香入梦频。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":99,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十四","author":"王冕","text":"朔风吹冷过山城，巾子峰头雪未晴。\n十载西湖閒客梦，夜来山月最分明。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":100,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十五","author":"王冕","text":"罗浮山下雪三尺，白玉堂前春几分。\n岁晏归来诗思好，东风吹散一溪云。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":101,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"题画梅","author":"王冕","text":"疏花粲粲照寒水，玛瑙坡前春独回。\n却忆去年风雪里，吹箫曾棹酒船来。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":102,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十七","author":"王冕","text":"天寒江国霜如雪，草木无情尽摧折。\n不知春意到江南，疏影横斜半窗月。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":103,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十八","author":"王冕","text":"春风处处竞繁华，桃李无言亦好花。\n独有高人爱高洁，肯冲冰雪到山家。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":104,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其十九","author":"王冕","text":"平生固守冰霜操，不与繁花一样情。\n岁晏溪头春意足，是谁看得最分明？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":105,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十","author":"王冕","text":"疏篱潇洒绿烟寒，老树鳞皴艾叶攒。\n昨夜天空明月白，一枝疏影隔窗看。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":106,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十一","author":"王冕","text":"春风一笑玉无垠，云散空窗见月痕。\n半夜鹤归诗思好，清香吹满水南轩。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":107,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十二","author":"王冕","text":"月明曾过西湖路，爱看横枝当水斜。\n试问玉堂诸学士，几时清梦到山家？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":108,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十三","author":"王冕","text":"明月满天霜气重，梅花风韵更清妍。\n鹤飞不带箫声远，春过西泠第二船。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":109,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十四","author":"王冕","text":"霜花浮影月娟娟，春色无痕上画船。\n转首西湖风景异，不知谁识老逋仙？","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":110,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十五","author":"王冕","text":"吹彻瑶笙鹤未还，小桥流水碧潺潺。\n夜深梦醒推窗看，白月无痕雪满山。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":111,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十六","author":"王冕","text":"鹅州城东古梅树，鳞甲满身如老龙。\n冷霜极冷欺不得，春风吹作玉玲珑。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":112,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十七","author":"王冕","text":"记得西泠春色归，珠星璧月景离离。\n近来消息真堪笑，却说梅花不要诗。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":113,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十八","author":"王冕","text":"开遍南枝又北枝，春风于我似相知。\n酒边漫说罗浮梦，忘却瑶台月下时。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":114,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其二十九","author":"王冕","text":"十月中原风景别，寒冰如地雪漫天。\n相逢尽说江南好，处处梅花压酒船。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":115,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十","author":"王冕","text":"溪谷冰霜春到迟，老夫长夜只吟诗。\n凭谁说与中朝士？\n此是江南第一枝。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":116,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十一","author":"王冕","text":"玛瑙坡前春未来，几番空棹酒船回。\n西湖今日清如许，一树梅花压水开。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":117,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十二","author":"王冕","text":"潇洒山林惯雪霜，不同桃李竞芬芳。\n何缘作得春风梦？\n一夜吹香到玉堂。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":118,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十三","author":"王冕","text":"此心如铁蕴阳和，不得春风也自花。\n何自高人爱潇洒？\n夜深踏雪到山家。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":119,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十四","author":"王冕","text":"铁石心肠冰雪颜，逢时亦有好花看。\n玉堂可有青毡旧？\n不畏风霜入骨寒。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":120,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十五","author":"王冕","text":"千年万年老梅树，三花五花无限春。\n不比寻常桃树李，只将颜色媚时人。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":121,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十六","author":"王冕","text":"霜气横空水满川，梅花枝上月娟娟。\n却思前载孤山下，半夜吹箫上画船。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":122,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十七","author":"王冕","text":"夜来漫踏前村雪，雪里梅花认得真。\n回首中原天万里，琼林玉树一般春。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":123,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十八","author":"王冕","text":"一树横斜白玉条，春风吹乱雪飘飘。\n孤山老却林和靖，多载笙歌过六桥。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":124,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其三十九","author":"王冕","text":"瘦铁一枝横照水，疏花点点耐清寒。\n雪晴月白孤山下，几度清香拄杖看。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":125,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}},{"title":"素梅五十八首 其四十","author":"王冕","text":"今日开门见远山，炼师坛下列清班。\n看来都是梅花树，个个春风玉佩环。","collection":"元末明初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元末明初.csv","pointer":126,"sha256":"e2e411b7b708d994056dbe022a77862f13e3bfddbb441220249443ddf0319215","dynasty":"元末明初"}}]